      "the navigation sdk for ios can display navigation on apple s carplay in dash head units and route voice guidance through the car s speakers",
      "gmsnavigationwaypoint can specify a location with a place id or a navigationpointtoken to improve routing accuracy and arrival handling",
      "the cancel button text color property in gmsnavigationtermsdialoguiparams controls the text color for the dialog s cancel button",
      "callouts for slowdowns and stalled vehicles are disabled and stalled vehicle voting and reporting are no longer available",
      "destinations created with a place id now highlight the destination building and show an entrance icon when possible",
      "prominent landmark pois are displayed along routes and near key intersections to help users orient themselves",
      "the navigation route can display callouts for unpaved road segments in supported regions and driving modes",
      "the default turn card header and footer designs were updated to match the newer rounded corner turn cards",
      "the sdk checks whether a user initiated vote on a real time disruption was submitted near the incident",
      "reusable styles associated with map ids can be used to style both the navigation map and the road map",
      "the incident reporting flow can be checked and launched programmatically using the new reporting apis",
      "the sdk can alert users about route disruptions and support reporting and verification of disruptions",
      "voice guidance now mentions traffic lights when describing upcoming maneuvers in supported countries",
      "the navigation route can display callouts for narrow roads in supported areas and driving modes",
      "the cycling guidance chevron points in the direction of device movement during active guidance",
      "callouts now appear before the next maneuver instead of at the moment the maneuver is needed",
      "the sdk now supports traffic light and stop sign icons along routes in additional countries",
      "the sdk s default map colors were updated to match the newer google maps app color palette",
      "gmsnavigatorsession is a new class for programmatically controlling a navigation session",
      "the shoulddisplayprompts method controls whether real time disruption callouts are shown",
      "the map hides low priority road labels that do not intersect with the current route"
    ],
